# game/script day12.rpy:20355
translate chinese day12_convincing_arthur_463aee4d:

    # "You do your best to act casual, trying to disguise the slosh of liquid as you hold your leverage close to your chest."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20357
translate chinese day12_convincing_arthur_3a2bc534:

    # "It's harder than you think it should be—keeping a bottle hidden on your person, but you manage to make a decent attempt at it, while the wind and the splash of waves hides any unfortunate misstep."
