# game/script day12.rpy:20381
translate chinese day12_convincing_arthur_7320dea2:

    # "Your mind wanders through how you came to all this."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20383
translate chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bc628f0f:

    # "You know you've grown a lot too in the last few days, considering you don't have to talk yourself up on the reason why anymore."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20385
translate chinese day12_convincing_arthur_bc9c0384:

    # "Earlier was just a pep talk."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20387
translate chinese day12_convincing_arthur_483eab30:

    # "Fortunately, being on a ship makes your journey a short one, though it does feel like a different world, treading lightly towards the officer's quarters."
    ""

# game/script day12.rpy:20389
translate chinese day12_convincing_arthur_db410b46:

    # "Plenty of lights, the reflection of candles against the ornate glass windows. And the fact that you could take a deep breath almost without the permeating smell that lingers almost everywhere else on the ship."
