# game/script day12.rpy:22110
translate chinese day12_convincing_arthur_continued_5efef7e2:

    # "So you make a quick retreat, pulling the door shut abruptly behind you. It's an unfamiliar and sticky joint, so you don't manage to pull it snug into the frame. Instead, it sticks, the wood creaking as it doesn't quite fit."
